'''Mega Shine''' (Japanese: '''シャイニングメガ''' ''Shining Mega'') is the fifth {{TCGP|B Series}} expansion in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Mega Shine''' is the third themed booster pack of the {{TCGP|B Series}} released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It introduces {{Shiny}} {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} to the game.

It is similar to {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} in the {{TCGP|A Series}}, which came out in the previous March.

