== Offering rates ==
The following table outlines the offering rates for each individual card in the Mega Shine booster pack.

The probability of each type of pack appearing is as follows:
* Regular pack - 94.706%
* Regular pack + 1 card - 5.238%
* Rare pack - 0.050%
* Themed rare pack - 0.005%

In regular packs with a bonus card, the card inclusion rates for the first five cards are the same as those for regular packs without a bonus card.

{{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Mew|86}} (#086), {{Rar/TCGP|Shiny|1}} and {{Rar/TCGP|Shiny|2}} rarity cards are only available as bonus cards.

The Themed rare pack will always contain the exact same cards: {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Mega Slowbro ex|112}} (#112) as the first card, {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Mega Manectric ex|113}} (#113) as the second card, {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Mega Scizor ex|115}} (#115) as the third card, {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Mega Charizard X ex|111}} (#111) as the fourth card, and {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Mega Gengar ex|114}} (#114) as the fifth card.

